{"id":"633558","name":"菠菜馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633558/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜汁","amount":"260克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜汁260克，然后加入酵母粉5克。","img":"images/633558/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入面粉500克加入20克白糖。","img":"images/633558/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/633558/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/633558/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖湿布发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/633558/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分成小剂子。","img":"images/633558/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成光滑面团，放入纸托。","img":"images/633558/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/633558/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后发酵两倍大。","img":"images/633558/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"发酵好的样子，大火蒸20分钟，焖五分钟即可。","img":"images/633558/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品，早餐吃。","img":"images/633558/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}